  "113": {
    "text": "󱤰 󱥩 󱤗. 󱤥 󱥞: 󱥘 walo, 󱤥 Kai 󱥠. 󱥒 󱤅󱤰: 󱥭 󱤗, 󱥠 󱤔. 󱥒 󱤅󱤰: 󱥭 󱥪. 󱥂: THE HUNTED LORD."
