  "114": {
    "text": "󱤰 󱥚 󱥩 󱤰 󱤅. 󱤝 󱥗 weka. 󱥎 󱤍 󱤬 󱥛. 󱥔 󱤂 󱥬 󱥩 Zakhan; 󱥷 󱥶 󱥩 Sommerlund. 󱤮 󱤯 󱥜 󱤬 󱥚. 󱥞 kepeken 󱥃 󱥇. 󱥔! 󱥩 󱥭 󱥪 Barrakeesh."
