  },
  "117": {
    "text": "󱤰 󱤨 󱥩 󱤗. 󱥭 󱥚 󱤓 󱤯 󱤛. 󱤬 󱤗 󱤛, Maouk 󱤟 󱤖 kepeken 󱤎 crossbow. '󱥌 󱥛, Lone Wolf!' 󱥞 󱤅 󱥩 󱥃 Maouk. '󱥞 󱥵, Kai!'"
