  "119": {
    "text": "󱤑 󱥮 󱤂 󱤮 󱥞. 󱤂 󱤅 󱥛 󱤽 󱤬 󱤽 3 󱥱, 󱥧 󱥱 󱥵 󱤊 wawa. 󱥱 󱤑 󱥮 󱥖 󱤑 wan."
