  "128": {
    "text": "󱥩 󱥭 󱤜 󱤰 󱤅. 󱥪 󱤍 󱤬 󱤅. 󱤶 󱤍 󱤔 󱤬 󱤅, 󱥎 󱤍! 󱥞 󱤈! 󱤰 󱤅 20 feet 󱥪 󱤍 󱤬 󱥒. Sharnazim 󱤖. 󱥞 󱤓 Rope, kepeken 󱤛 󱤎 󱥩 󱤔 󱥩 󱤯 󱤆."
  },
  "129": {
    "text": "󱤥 󱤬 󱥏, 󱤮 󱤔. 󱤰 󱤋 󱤼 Sharnazim. 󱤍 󱤬 󱤔; 󱤃 󱤰 󱤥 󱤆. 󱤑 󱤈 󱤃 󱥭. 󱥞 󱥩 󱤰 󱤋, 󱥱 󱥩 Maouk 󱤊 Sharnazim 󱤼󱤅."
  },
  "130": {
    "text": "󱥞 󱥌 Herb Pad 󱥧 󱤑 󱤷 (Special Item). 󱤥 󱥰 kepeken 󱥓 󱤗 󱥔. 󱤗 󱥔 󱥔 󱤝 󱤍. 󱥝 󱥳 󱥛 (ENDURANCE). 󱤑 󱤷 󱤅, Sharnazim 󱤖. 󱤂 󱤘 󱥶—󱥷 󱤥."
  },
  "131": {
    "text": "󱤃 󱤎 󱤼 󱤬 supa:\n• Silver Comb\n• Hourglass\n• Dagger\n• Healing Potion of Laumspur (+4 ENDURANCE)\n• Prism\n• 󱤶 󱤼󱤅 Meals (1 Meal = 1 Backpack Item)\n󱥠 󱤪 Action Chart."
